OL,3,GNEWSACoal mine heat network goes live
OL,4,
OL,5,FA mine water heating system which will
OL,6,Feventually supply hundreds of homes has
OL,7,Fgone live.
OL,9,FThe ultra-low carbon district heat
OL,10,Fnetwork now supplies heat to about 50
OL,11,Fproperties in the Seaham Garden Village
OL,12,Fdevelopment.
OL,14,FThe scheme will eventually supply 750
OL,15,Fhomes in the 1,500-home complex that is
OL,16,Fdue to be built over the next 10 years.
OL,18,FDurham County Council said it was
OL,19,Fexploring whether similar schemes could
OL,20,Fbe set up elsewhere. Other networks are
OL,21,Falready running in places such as
OL,22,FGateshead.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
